    "After the free week, the subscription renews unless you cancel." : {
      "comment" : "Referrals (#97): the renewal terms, shown to the referrer under the weeks they earned and in the 'You earned a week of Pro' alert. The second half of the friend's 'Apple shows the offer…' sentence, translated the same way.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
