    "Google doesn't use them to train its models, and we don't keep them after you get your answer." : {
      "comment" : "AI consent screen.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google nutzt sie nicht zum Training seiner Modelle, und wir speichern sie nicht, nachdem du deine Antwort bekommen hast."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google doesn't use them to train its models, and we don't keep them after you get your answer."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google no los usa para entrenar sus modelos y nosotros no los guardamos después de darte la respuesta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google ne les utilise pas pour entraîner ses modèles, et nous ne les conservons pas après ta réponse."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google non li usa per addestrare i suoi modelli, e noi non li conserviamo dopo che hai ricevuto la risposta."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Googleはこれらをモデルの学習に使わず、私たちも回答後に保持しません。"
