            "value" : "Tá, falando sério:"
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bine, acum serios:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好了，说正经的："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On new scans, Pro shows four price points, what drives the value, and how to sharpen the estimate. This find keeps the summary it was saved with." : {
      "comment" : "Caption in the locked \"Why this price\" teaser, shown to a free user on a find reopened from My Finds or My Flips that was saved with only the free part of the panel. Buying does not re-read such a find, so this says the full panel comes with new scans. The second sentence is the one the \"Scanned before Pro\" note uses after they buy.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei neuen Scans zeigt Pro vier Preispunkte, was den Wert treibt, und wie du die Schätzung schärfst. Dieser Fund behält die Zusammenfassung, mit der er gespeichert wurde."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On new scans, Pro shows four price points, what drives the value, and how to sharpen the estimate. This find keeps the summary it was saved with."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En los escaneos nuevos, Pro muestra cuatro niveles de precio, qué sube el valor y cómo afinar la estimación. Este hallazgo conserva el resumen con el que se guardó."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur les nouveaux scans, Pro affiche quatre niveaux de prix, ce qui fait la valeur et comment affiner l'estimation. Cette trouvaille garde le résumé avec lequel elle a été enregistrée."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nelle nuove scansioni, Pro mostra quattro livelli di prezzo, cosa determina il valore e come affinare la stima. Questa scoperta mantiene il riepilogo con cui è stata salvata."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しいスキャンでは、Proは4段階の価格、価値を決める要素、査定を絞り込む方法を表示します。このお宝は保存時の概要のままです。"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W nowych skanach Pro pokazuje cztery poziomy cen, co wpływa na wartość i jak doprecyzować wycenę. To znalezisko zachowuje podsumowanie, z którym zostało zapisane."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nos escaneamentos novos, o Pro mostra quatro faixas de preço, o que define o valor e como afinar a estimativa. Este achado mantém o resumo com que foi salvo."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La scanările noi, Pro îți arată patru praguri de preț, ce ridică valoarea și cum faci estimarea mai exactă. Găselnița asta păstrează rezumatul cu care a fost salvată."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新扫描时，Pro 会显示四个价格档位、什么在抬高价值，以及怎样让估价更准。这件好物保留的是保存时的摘要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more details differ from what genuine items usually show. Look closer before you pay." : {
      "comment" : "Legit check: under 'Some details look off'.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein oder mehrere Details weichen von dem ab, was Originalartikel üblicherweise zeigen. Sieh genauer hin, bevor du bezahlst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One or more details differ from what genuine items usually show. Look closer before you pay."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uno o más detalles difieren de lo que suelen mostrar los artículos originales. Míralo con más atención antes de pagar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un ou plusieurs détails diffèrent de ce que montrent habituellement les articles authentiques. Regarde de plus près avant de payer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uno o più dettagli sono diversi da come appaiono di solito negli articoli originali. Guarda meglio prima di pagare."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本物によく見られる特徴と異なる点が1つ以上あります。支払う前によく確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Co najmniej jeden szczegół różni się od tego, jak zwykle wyglądają oryginały. Przyjrzyj się, zanim zapłacisz."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Um ou mais detalhes diferem do que os itens originais costumam mostrar. Olhe com mais atenção antes de pagar."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unul sau mai multe detalii diferă de ceea ce arată de obicei articolele originale. Uită-te mai atent înainte să plătești."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有一处或多处细节与正品通常的样子不同。付款前请仔细查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One photo of a rail or shelf, and the items most worth a closer look" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint for the Rack button on the Scan tab.",
