    },
    "SnapWorth uses Google's Gemini AI to identify items and estimate what they're worth. To do that, it sends Google:" : {
      "comment" : "AI consent screen: what is sent, followed by a list. Google and Gemini are names.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth nutzt die KI Gemini von Google, um Artikel zu erkennen und ihren Wert zu schätzen. Dafür sendet die App an Google:"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth uses Google's Gemini AI to identify items and estimate what they're worth. To do that, it sends Google:"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth usa la IA Gemini de Google para identificar artículos y estimar cuánto valen. Para ello, envía a Google:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth utilise l'IA Gemini de Google pour identifier les articles et estimer leur valeur. Pour cela, il envoie à Google :"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth usa l'IA Gemini di Google per identificare gli articoli e stimarne il valore. Per farlo, invia a Google:"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorthはアイテムの識別と価値の査定にGoogleのGemini AIを使います。そのため、Googleに次のものを送信します："
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth używa AI Gemini od Google, by rozpoznawać przedmioty i szacować ich wartość. W tym celu wysyła do Google:"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O SnapWorth usa a IA Gemini do Google para identificar itens e estimar quanto valem. Para isso, envia ao Google:"
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SnapWorth folosește inteligența artificială Gemini de la Google ca să identifice obiectele și să estimeze cât valorează. Pentru asta, trimite către Google:"
