    "This doesn't look like something with a resale value. Try describing a single item you'd actually sell." : {
      "comment" : "An error the server sent with a code this build words itself (backend/core/apierrors.py), for a scan made from a typed description rather than a photo. In English the server's own sentence is shown instead. The server's English also gives the AI's reason, which is model text in English; this sentence is shown without it.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das sieht nicht nach etwas mit Wiederverkaufswert aus. Versuch, einen einzelnen Artikel zu beschreiben, den du wirklich verkaufen würdest."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This doesn't look like something with a resale value. Try describing a single item you'd actually sell."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto no parece algo con valor de reventa. Prueba a describir un solo artículo que de verdad venderías."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ça ne ressemble pas à quelque chose qui se revend. Essaie de décrire un seul article que tu vendrais vraiment."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Non sembra qualcosa con un valore di rivendita. Prova a descrivere un solo articolo che venderesti davvero."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リセール価値のあるものには見えません。実際に売りたいアイテム1点を説明してみてください。"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To nie wygląda na coś z wartością odsprzedaży. Spróbuj opisać jeden przedmiot, który naprawdę byś sprzedał(a)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto não parece algo com valor de revenda. Tente descrever um único item que você realmente venderia."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nu pare să fie ceva ce se poate revinde. Încearcă să descrii un singur obiect pe care chiar l-ai vinde."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这看起来不像有转卖价值的东西。请描述一件你真的会卖的单件物品。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This find was saved without its full breakdown. Re-read its photo to see the price points and what drives the value. The estimate, the item's name and details, and the listing draft may change." : {
      "comment" : "Shown to a subscriber under \"Why this price\" when the find was saved with only the free part of the panel (usually scanned before they subscribed). A re-read replaces the estimate, name, brand, category, condition notes and listing draft, so all of them are named.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Fund wurde ohne die vollständige Aufschlüsselung gespeichert. Lies sein Foto neu, um die Preispunkte zu sehen und was den Wert treibt. Dabei können sich die Schätzung, Name und Details des Artikels und der Inserat-Entwurf ändern."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This find was saved without its full breakdown. Re-read its photo to see the price points and what drives the value. The estimate, the item's name and details, and the listing draft may change."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este hallazgo se guardó sin el desglose completo. Vuelve a leer su foto para ver los niveles de precio y qué sube el valor. Pueden cambiar la estimación, el nombre y los detalles del artículo, y el borrador del anuncio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette trouvaille a été enregistrée sans son détail complet. Relis sa photo pour voir les niveaux de prix et ce qui fait la valeur. L'estimation, le nom et les détails de l'article, ainsi que le brouillon d'annonce, peuvent changer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questa scoperta è stata salvata senza il dettaglio completo. Rileggi la sua foto per vedere i livelli di prezzo e cosa determina il valore. La stima, il nome e i dettagli dell'articolo e la bozza dell'annuncio potrebbero cambiare."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このお宝は詳しい内訳なしで保存されました。写真を読み直すと、価格帯と価値を決める要素が表示されます。査定額、アイテム名や詳細、出品文の下書きが変わることがあります。"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To znalezisko zapisano bez pełnego zestawienia. Odczytaj zdjęcie ponownie, by zobaczyć poziomy cen i to, co wpływa na wartość. Wycena, nazwa i szczegóły przedmiotu oraz szkic ogłoszenia mogą się zmienić."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este achado foi salvo sem o detalhamento completo. Releia a foto para ver as faixas de preço e o que define o valor. A estimativa, o nome e os detalhes do item e o rascunho do anúncio podem mudar."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Găselnița asta a fost salvată fără analiza completă. Recitește-i fotografia ca să vezi pragurile de preț și ce ridică valoarea. Se pot schimba estimarea, numele și detaliile obiectului și ciorna de anunț."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这件好物保存时没有完整分析。重新识别它的照片，就能看到价格档位和什么在抬高价值。估价、物品名称和细节，以及商品描述草稿都可能随之改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
